      "content": "WIGGINTON             ROSSWAY SP 90 NE                                        (West side) 7/167                                  Barn in S range of N yard -                                      and Cartshed extending to                                        S at Rossway Home Farm GV                                     II Barn and cartshed.  Barn C16 or early C17 with C18 inserted floor: cartshed C19 re-using older frames. Timber frames on brick sill walls, dark weatherboarded. High flint and brick rear wall to cartshed is farm boundary wall. Steep old red tile roofs. 4 bays barn facing N has stable doors and boarded doors into upper part. Jowled posts and inclined queen-posts  supporting  a  single  large  purlin  in  each  slope  with wind-braces. Inserted floor to make stables with hay loft over. 5 bays open-fronted tall cartshed facing W with rear aisle. 2 bays at N are older and have collar-and-queen-strut trusses to clasped purlin roof. 2 S bays have king strut trusses. Straight braces to open arcaded front. Listing NGR: SP9584807316"
    }
  ],
